# HealthSync v4.0 Environment Variables Template

## Frontend Environment Variables (.env.local)

```bash
# Supabase Configuration
NEXT_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_URL=https://your-project.supabase.co
NEXT_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=your-anon-key

# API Configuration
NEXT_PUBLIC_API_URL=http://localhost:8000  # Development
# NEXT_PUBLIC_API_URL=https://api.healthsync.com  # Production

# Feature Flags
NEXT_PUBLIC_ENABLE_V4_FEATURES=true
NEXT_PUBLIC_CHAT_QUERY_LIMIT=10
NEXT_PUBLIC_CHAT_SESSION_TTL=7  # days

# Optional: Analytics
NEXT_PUBLIC_ANALYTICS_ID=your-analytics-id  # Optional
NEXT_PUBLIC_SENTRY_DSN=https://...@sentry.io/...  # Optional
```

## Backend Environment Variables (.env)

```bash
# ============================================================================
# Core Configuration
# ============================================================================
ENVIRONMENT=development  # development, staging, production
DEBUG=false

# ============================================================================
# Database Configuration (PostgreSQL via Supabase)
# ============================================================================
DATABASE_URL=postgresql://user:password@db.supabase.co:5432/postgres
SUPABASE_URL=https://your-project.supabase.co
SUPABASE_SERVICE_ROLE_KEY=your-service-role-key
SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=your-anon-key

# RLS Configuration
USE_SUPABASE_RLS=true  # Enable Row-Level Security

# ============================================================================
# Redis Configuration (Session Context + Caching)
# ============================================================================
REDIS_URL=redis://localhost:6379/0
REDIS_DB=0
REDIS_POOL_SIZE=10
REDIS_TIMEOUT=5

# Session Configuration
REDIS_SESSION_TTL=604800  # 7 days in seconds
REDIS_CACHE_TTL=1800     # 30 minutes in seconds

# ============================================================================
# AI/LLM APIs
# ============================================================================

# Gemini API (Text Embeddings)
GEMINI_API_KEY=your-gemini-api-key
GEMINI_EMBEDDING_MODEL=text-embedding-004
GEMINI_EMBEDDING_DIMENSIONS=768

# Groq API (LLM Generation)
GROQ_API_KEY=your-groq-api-key
GROQ_MODEL=mixtral-8x7b-32768
GROQ_TEMPERATURE=0.2  # Medical: deterministic
GROQ_MAX_TOKENS=500

# ============================================================================
# Vector Database (ChromaDB)
# ============================================================================
CHROMA_DB_PATH=./chroma_db
CHROMA_COLLECTION_NAME=medical_notes
CHROMA_DISTANCE_METRIC=cosine

# ============================================================================
# NLP Models (spaCy - Patient Extraction)
# ============================================================================
SPACY_MODEL=en_core_web_sm
SPACY_CONFIDENCE_THRESHOLD=0.7  # Auto-select if confidence > this

# ============================================================================
# Transcription Service (ElevenLabs - Optional)
# ============================================================================
ELEVENLABS_API_KEY=your-elevenlabs-key  # Optional
ELEVENLABS_VOICE_ID=your-voice-id        # Optional

# ============================================================================
# JWT & Security
# ============================================================================
JWT_SECRET_KEY=your-secret-key-min-32-chars
JWT_ALGORITHM=HS256
JWT_EXPIRATION_MINUTES=60
JWT_REFRESH_EXPIRATION_DAYS=7

# PII Encryption
FERNET_KEY=your-fernet-key  # python -c "from cryptography.fernet import Fernet; print(Fernet.generate_key())"

# ============================================================================
# Rate Limiting
# ============================================================================
RATE_LIMIT_SEARCH=30/minute
RATE_LIMIT_PROCESSING=10/minute
RATE_LIMIT_AUTH=5/minute
RATE_LIMIT_TRANSCRIPTION=20/minute

# ============================================================================
# Server Configuration
# ============================================================================
HOST=0.0.0.0
PORT=8000
WORKERS=4  # Number of Uvicorn workers

# ============================================================================
# CORS Configuration
# ============================================================================
CORS_ORIGINS=http://localhost:3000,https://localhost:3000,https://healthsync.com
CORS_ALLOW_CREDENTIALS=true
CORS_ALLOW_METHODS=GET,POST,PUT,DELETE,OPTIONS
CORS_ALLOW_HEADERS=*

# ============================================================================
# Logging Configuration
# ============================================================================
LOG_LEVEL=INFO  # DEBUG, INFO, WARNING, ERROR, CRITICAL
LOG_FORMAT=json  # json or text
LOG_FILE=./logs/app.log  # Optional file logging

# ============================================================================
# Celery Configuration (Background Tasks)
# ============================================================================
CELERY_BROKER_URL=redis://localhost:6379/1
CELERY_RESULT_BACKEND=redis://localhost:6379/2
CELERY_WORKER_CONCURRENCY=4

# ============================================================================
# Monitoring & Observability
# ============================================================================

# Sentry Error Tracking (Optional)
SENTRY_DSN=https://...@sentry.io/...
SENTRY_ENVIRONMENT=production
SENTRY_TRACES_SAMPLE_RATE=0.1

# Custom Telemetry (Optional)
ENABLE_TELEMETRY=true
TELEMETRY_ENDPOINT=http://localhost:8001/metrics

# ============================================================================
# Feature Flags (v4.0)
# ============================================================================
ENABLE_MULTI_CHAT=true              # Enable multi-chat system
ENABLE_PATIENT_EXTRACTION=true      # Enable spaCy NER
ENABLE_DISAMBIGUATION=true          # Enable patient selection modal
ENABLE_SESSION_CONTEXT=true         # Enable pronoun resolution
ENABLE_AUDIT_LOGGING=true           # Enable compliance logging

# Chat Configuration
CHAT_QUERY_LIMIT=10                 # Queries per chat before "full"
SESSION_CONTEXT_TTL=604800          # 7 days

# Patient Extraction Thresholds
PATIENT_CONFIDENCE_AUTO_SELECT=0.85 # Auto-select if > this
PATIENT_CONFIDENCE_DISAMBIGUATION=0.70  # Require user selection if < this

# ============================================================================
# Optional Integrations
# ============================================================================

# Slack Notifications (Optional)
SLACK_WEBHOOK_URL=https://hooks.slack.com/services/...
SLACK_CHANNEL=#healthsync-alerts
SLACK_NOTIFY_ON_ERROR=true

# Email Notifications (Optional)
SMTP_HOST=smtp.gmail.com
SMTP_PORT=587
SMTP_USER=your-email@gmail.com
SMTP_PASSWORD=your-app-password
SMTP_FROM=notifications@healthsync.com

# ============================================================================
# Performance Tuning
# ============================================================================

# Query Optimization
BATCH_EMBEDDING_SIZE=32
BATCH_RERANKING_SIZE=50
RETRIEVAL_TOP_K=50

# Caching
ENABLE_QUERY_CACHE=true
CACHE_TTL_MINUTES=30

# Connection Pooling
DB_POOL_SIZE=20
DB_POOL_RECYCLE=3600
DB_POOL_PRE_PING=true

# ============================================================================
# Advanced Configuration
# ============================================================================

# PII Detection
ENABLE_PII_MASKING=true
ENABLE_PII_VALIDATION=true
PII_VALIDATION_CONFIDENCE=0.95

# Token Restoration
ENABLE_TOKEN_RESTORATION=true

# Query Classification
ENABLE_QUERY_CLASSIFICATION=true
QUERY_CLASSIFICATION_CONFIDENCE=0.80
```

## Docker Compose Configuration (.env.docker)

```bash
# Used by docker-compose.yml for local development

# PostgreSQL (Supabase)
POSTGRES_USER=postgres
POSTGRES_PASSWORD=your-strong-password
POSTGRES_DB=healthsync
POSTGRES_INITDB_ARGS=-c max_connections=100

# Redis
REDIS_PASSWORD=your-redis-password

# PgVector Extension
POSTGRES_INITDB_ARGS=-c shared_preload_libraries=vector

# Backend Service
BACKEND_PORT=8000

# Frontend Service
FRONTEND_PORT=3000
```

## Quick Start

### Development Setup

```bash
# 1. Copy this template
cp .env.example .env

# 2. Fill in required values
#    - GEMINI_API_KEY
#    - GROQ_API_KEY
#    - SUPABASE_URL + SUPABASE_KEY
#    - JWT_SECRET_KEY

# 3. Generate security keys
# JWT Secret (32+ characters)
openssl rand -base64 32

# Fernet Key (for PII encryption)
python -c "from cryptography.fernet import Fernet; print(Fernet.generate_key().decode())"

# 4. Verify configuration
python -c "from core.config import settings; print('✅ Config loaded')"
```

### Validation

```bash
# Verify all required keys are present
python scripts/validate_env.py

# Expected output:
# ✅ DATABASE_URL configured
# ✅ REDIS_URL configured
# ✅ GEMINI_API_KEY configured
# ✅ GROQ_API_KEY configured
# ⚠️ SENTRY_DSN not configured (optional)
```

## Environment Profiles

### Development

```bash
ENVIRONMENT=development
DEBUG=true
LOG_LEVEL=DEBUG
ENABLE_TELEMETRY=false
CHAT_QUERY_LIMIT=100  # Higher limit for testing
```

### Staging

```bash
ENVIRONMENT=staging
DEBUG=false
LOG_LEVEL=INFO
ENABLE_TELEMETRY=true
CHAT_QUERY_LIMIT=10
```

### Production

```bash
ENVIRONMENT=production
DEBUG=false
LOG_LEVEL=WARNING
ENABLE_TELEMETRY=true
CHAT_QUERY_LIMIT=10
USE_SUPABASE_RLS=true
```

## Version Notes

- **v4.0 Changes:**
  - New: REDIS_URL (now required for session context)
  - New: SPACY_MODEL (for patient extraction)
  - New: Feature flags for v4.0 features
  - Unchanged: Existing v3.1 variables still valid

- **Backwards Compatibility:** All v3.1 .env files will work with v4.0
- **New Required:** REDIS_URL is critical for multi-chat system

